@startuml InternalMicroserviceCatalogUseCases

' ──────────────────────────────────────────────
' Title
' ──────────────────────────────────────────────
title Internal Microservice Catalog & Health Portal\nUML Use-Case Diagram

' ──────────────────────────────────────────────
' Actors
' ──────────────────────────────────────────────
actor "DevOps Engineer" as DevOps
actor "System Architect" as Architect
actor "Notification Service\n(External)" as NotifSvc <<external>>

' ──────────────────────────────────────────────
' System Boundary
' ──────────────────────────────────────────────
rectangle "Internal Microservice Catalog & Health Portal" {

    ' ── Primary Use Cases ──
    usecase "Register / Update\nMicroservice" as UC1
    usecase "Search Service\nCatalog" as UC2
    usecase "View Dependency\nGraph" as UC3
    usecase "Monitor Service\nHealth" as UC4
    usecase "View API\nDocumentation" as UC5
    usecase "Configure Alert\nChannels" as UC6

    ' ── Included Use Cases ──
    usecase "Authenticate via\nEnterprise SSO" as UC_Auth
    usecase "Validate Service\nMetadata" as UC_Validate

    ' ── Extended Use Case ──
    usecase "Dispatch Downtime\nAlert" as UC_Alert

}

' ──────────────────────────────────────────────
' Actor ↔ Use-Case Associations
' ──────────────────────────────────────────────
DevOps --> UC1
DevOps --> UC2
DevOps --> UC4
DevOps --> UC5
DevOps --> UC6

Architect --> UC2
Architect --> UC3
Architect --> UC5

' ──────────────────────────────────────────────
' «include» Relationships
' ──────────────────────────────────────────────
UC1 ..> UC_Auth : <<include>>
UC1 ..> UC_Validate : <<include>>
UC4 ..> UC_Auth : <<include>>

' ──────────────────────────────────────────────
' «extend» Relationship
' ──────────────────────────────────────────────
UC_Alert ..> UC4 : <<extend>>\n[3 consecutive\nfailed probes]

' ──────────────────────────────────────────────
' External Actor Association
' ──────────────────────────────────────────────
UC_Alert --> NotifSvc

' ──────────────────────────────────────────────
' Notes
' ──────────────────────────────────────────────
note right of UC_Alert
  Triggered automatically when
  health monitoring detects 3
  consecutive failed health probes.
  Sends alerts via Email, Slack,
  and Webhook.
end note

note bottom of UC_Auth
  All portal actions
  require enterprise
  SSO authentication.
end note

@enduml
